pan begin="00:19.140" end="00:19.470">I'll </span><span begin="00:19.470" end="00:19.950">go </span><span begin="00:19.950" end="00:21.690">anywhere </span><span begin="00:21.690" end="00:22.020">with </span><span begin="00:22.020" end="00:23.730">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.330" end="00:28.350"><span begin="00:24.330" end="00:24.780">just </span><span begin="00:24.780" end="00:25.380">wrap </span><span begin="00:25.380" end="00:26.040">me </span><span begin="00:26.040" end="00:26.370">up </span><span begin="00:26.370" end="00:26.850">in </span><span begin="00:26.850" end="00:28.350">chains</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.710" end="00:33.450"><span begin="00:28.710" end="00:29.220">but </span><span begin="00:29.220" end="00:29.460">if </span><span begin="00:29.460" end="00:29.670">you </span><span begin="00:29.670" end="00:30.630">try </span><span begin="00:30.630" end="00:30.930">to </span><span begin="00:30.930" end="00:31.410">go </span><span begin="00:31.410" end="00:33.450">alone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.320" end="00:40.890"><span begin="00:34.320" end="00:34.710">don't </span><span begin="00:34.710" end="00:35.490">think </span><span begin="00:35.490" end="00:36.060">I'll </span><span begin="00:36.060" end="00:40.890">understand</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.000" end="01:01.470"><span begin="00:42.000" end="00:44.520">stay </span><span begin="00:44.520" end="00:47.130">with </span><span begin="00:47.130" end="00:50.670">me</span><span begin="00:50.670" end="00:51.870">, </span><span begin="00:51.870" end="00:54.450">stay </span><span begin="00:54.450" end="00:57.030">with </span><span begin="00:57.030" end="01:00.270">me</span><span begin="01:00.270" end="01:01.470">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.470" end="01:05.850"><span begin="01:01.470" end="01:01.800">In </span><span begin="01:01.800" end="01:01.890">the </span><span begin="01:01.890" end="01:03.360">silence </span><span begin="01:03.360" en