.410" end="02:08.460">day</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.460" end="02:11.040"><span begin="02:08.460" end="02:08.760">in </span><span begin="02:08.760" end="02:09.120">your </span><span begin="02:09.120" end="02:09.630">own </span><span begin="02:09.630" end="02:11.040">world</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.960" end="02:18.360"><span begin="02:12.960" end="02:13.380">cause </span><span begin="02:13.380" end="02:13.710">when </span><span begin="02:13.710" end="02:13.860">you </span><span begin="02:13.860" end="02:14.370">sleep </span><span begin="02:14.370" end="02:14.820">at </span><span begin="02:14.820" end="02:15.810">night </span><span begin="02:15.810" end="02:16.110">they </span><span begin="02:16.110" end="02:16.740">don't </span><span begin="02:16.740" end="02:17.040">hear </span><span begin="02:17.040" end="02:17.250">your </span><span begin="02:17.250" end="02:18.360">cries</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.360" end="02:19.950"><span begin="02:18.360" end="02:18.630">in </span><span begin="02:18.630" end="02:19.020">your </span><span begin="02:19.020" end="02:19.590">own </span><span begin="02:19.590" end="02:19.950">world</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.280" end="02:27.930"><span begin="02:23.280" end="02:23.820">only </span><span begin="02:23.820" end="02:24.540">time </span><span begin="02:24.540" end="02:24.750">will </span><span begin="02:24.750" end="02:25.530">tell </span><span begin="02:25.530" end="02:25.830">if </span><span begin="02:25.830" end="02:26.010">you </span><span begin="02:26.010" end="02:26.640">can </span><span begin="02:26.640" end="02:27.000">break </span><span begin="02:27.000" end="02:27.150">the </span><span begin="02:27.150" end="02:27.930">spell</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.930" end="02:32.040"><span begin="02:27.930" end="02:28.350">back </span><span begin="02:28.350" end="02:28.620">in </span><span begin="02:28.620" end="02:29.010">your </span><span begin="02:29.010" end="02:29.